flowchart TB
  accTitle: Nib deployment and persistent storage
  accDescr: A single non-root Docker process serves the local dashboard and OBS through host loopback, keeps credentials server-side, and writes its ledger, anonymous familiarity and six-hour response history to a persistent data mount.
  Twitch["Twitch services<br/>IRC / OAuth / Helix / thumbnails"]
  OpenAI["OpenAI API<br/>Text + image input"]

  subgraph PC["Streamer PC · single local installation"]
    Browser["Browser dashboard<br/>http://127.0.0.1:3000/"]
    OBS["OBS Browser Source<br/>Same host, /?overlay=1"]
    Port["Host loopback port 3000<br/>HTTP / local controls / SSE"]
    Env["Local .env<br/>Keys + startup configuration<br/>Excluded from Git and image"]

    subgraph CONTAINER["Docker · non-root / read-only root"]
      Server["Node.js 22 + Express<br/>Server + bundled client assets<br/>Localhost Host / Origin checks"]
    end

    Data[("Persistent data mount<br/>ai-state.json · relationships.json<br/>conversation-log.json · server.lock")]
    Browser <-->|HTTP / SSE| Port
    OBS <-->|HTTP / SSE| Port
    Port <--> Server
    Env -->|server environment| Server
    Server <-->|one writer / atomic JSON| Data
  end

  Twitch -->|receive chat / fetch still| Server
  Server <-->|server-side requests| OpenAI

